Subject: [PATCH] Metrics and truthful readiness (Track O): GET /metrics
 (loopback only) with golden signals by route template, release_info, live
 streams, WebSocket connections per server and outbox depth; /api/ready checks
 boot + db (required) and SFU, Media, Network key (optional, reported as
 degraded); openvibe-shared v1.3.0

